      <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-3">The trade-offs are the annual-only billing structure, a small 2-location US footprint, and the fact that DediRock is a younger host than the established budget leaders. It is an annual-contract value play, not an hourly-scaled cloud — so pair it with the right workload, not as a universal replacement.</p>
      <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">For a more established budget option with month-to-month flexibility, see our <a href="/vps/racknerd" class="text-orange-400 hover:underline">RackNerd review</a>. For instant hourly-scaled cloud across 32+ locations, see <a href="/vps/vultr" class="text-orange-400 hover:underline">Vultr</a>. All DediRock specs and prices verified live from <a href="https://dedirock.com/thei9dream/" class="text-orange-400 hover:underline">dedirock.com/thei9dream/</a> (HTTP 200, August 2026).</p>
